## English Summary

Serica is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The full text is in the LICENSE file at the repository root.

**Third-party source dependencies: none.** The compiler, runtime, standard library, and toolchain are all original implementations. Build outputs must not contain `.c` intermediate files, `libLLVM`, `libpython`, or `libnode`.

**Build-time toolchain:** the Go toolchain (`>=1.23`, BSD-3-Clause) is required only to build the seed compiler. It is not distributed with this project, and it ceases to be a build dependency once self-hosting is complete and the seed compiler is removed.

**Link-time components:** only operating-system-provided linkers are invoked. They are not distributed with this project.

**Third-party names in documentation:** names such as C, C++, Rust, Go, Zig, Python, JavaScript, LLVM, and WebAssembly appear in the specification and README solely for design comparison. No source code, binaries, or documentation from those projects are included. All such names and trademarks belong to their respective owners.

**Fonts and images:** this repository contains no image or font assets. README badges are rendered dynamically by shields.io and are not stored in this repository.
